      en: ["Geography: Located at the center of the Indo-Gangetic Plain.", "Architecture: The Residency complex still bears scars from the 1857 Siege.", "Economy: A significant center for aeronautics and heavy engineering.", "Sports: Home to one of the largest cricket stadiums in India (Ekana).", "Literacy: Average literacy rate is approximately 82.5%.", "Historical Site: Chhota Imambara is also known as the Palace of Lights.", "Culture: Lucknow is a major center for the Kathak classical dance form.", "Connectivity: Connected via the 302 km Agra-Lucknow Expressway."],
